<!-- @after 12. Further Reading :: recap -->
### Say these in the interview

- Choose session or user pinning for the surface; lasting effects need a stable user assignment.
- Carry the original assignment handle through the flow so a delayed conversion cannot credit a later arm.
- Commit the first-exposure marker and its stable-ID outbox event in one Room transaction.
- Send exposure and rewards through one ordered trial outbox; keep events unsettled when the server cannot place them yet.
- Count exposed non-converters as zero after the window plus delivery grace, and state the final late-delivery policy.
